            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby uniknąć błędu, najpierw sprawdź, czy element znajduje się w zbiorze, zanim go usuniesz, tak jak w przypadku <code>\"History\"</code> tutaj.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"classes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Geometry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;History&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" classes:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  classes.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;History&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(classes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Geometry', 'French', 'Music'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>if</code>, następnie <code>\"History\"</code>, a potem <code>in</code>, <code>classes:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby uniknąć błędu, najpierw sprawdź, czy element znajduje się w zbiorze, zanim go usuniesz, tak jak w przypadku <code>\"History\"</code> tutaj.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"classes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Geometry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;History&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" classes:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  classes.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;History&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(classes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Music&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Geometry&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>if</code>, następnie <code>\"History\"</code>, <code>in</code> i na końcu <code>classes:</code>.</p></body></html>",
